{"journal_version":1,"sequence":10,"replace_from":12,"message_count":13,"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Done.\n\n**Change** (`app/page.tsx`, rightmost mail-reading column toolbar):\n- Toolbar remains `sticky top-0` (now with `z-10`) over the scrolling message pane, keeping its bottom divider and light/dark background.\n- Removed the per-button wrapper `div`s that carried `border-r` / `px-4` / `pr-4` separators and the `space-x-4` gap, so the icon buttons sit flush against each other like a macOS toolbar.\n- Swapped `variant=\"outline\"` → `variant=\"ghost\"` to drop the button borders (and shadow); the five options (Mail, Trash, Reply, Forward, Search) are unchanged, with Search still pushed to the right via `ml-auto`.\n- Padding tightened from `p-4` to `p-2`; all other columns, the message body, and the icon components are untouched.\n\n**Commands run:**\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, `render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 26873 bytes`\n\n**Remaining risks:** Verification is a render smoke check only — it doesn't assert visual styling, so sticky behavior and flush spacing were reviewed by reading the markup, not eyeballed in a browser. Ghost buttons rely on hover background for affordance, which is a minor visual change inherent to removing borders.","response_items":[{"id":"fa6f596b-bb03-4017-8676-0dc35ec74352","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"Done.\n\n**Change** (`app/page.tsx`, rightmost mail-reading column toolbar):\n- Toolbar remains `sticky top-0` (now with `z-10`) over the scrolling message pane, keeping its bottom divider and light/dark background.\n- Removed the per-button wrapper `div`s that carried `border-r` / `px-4` / `pr-4` separators and the `space-x-4` gap, so the icon buttons sit flush against each other like a macOS toolbar.\n- Swapped `variant=\"outline\"` → `variant=\"ghost\"` to drop the button borders (and shadow); the five options (Mail, Trash, Reply, Forward, Search) are unchanged, with Search still pushed to the right via `ml-auto`.\n- Padding tightened from `p-4` to `p-2`; all other columns, the message body, and the icon components are untouched.\n\n**Commands run:**\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, `render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 26873 bytes`\n\n**Remaining risks:** Verification is a render smoke check only — it doesn't assert visual styling, so sticky behavior and flush spacing were reviewed by reading the markup, not eyeballed in a browser. Ghost buttons rely on hover background for affordance, which is a minor visual change inherent to removing borders.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:11:20.343952+00:00"}],"meta":{"snapshot_version":1,"aid":0,"role":"workflow_agent","model":"deepseek-flash","session_state":{"used_tokens":34678,"context_tokens":7529,"step_count":6,"markup_recovered":0,"recent_call_hashes":["acfbe2cdd7049d2db70952173174e3eb","6bbf2e5d222783f4bd1a52d64d0bb22c","5b68832455395b15358301cceed35cd2","3c45d71dcb1acaddc13d0e86e5418077","62ee204ab04cbaac847c6386000d8080"],"reads_since_last_edit":0,"has_landed_write":true,"low_yield_since_progress":0,"distinct_evidence_count":5,"scout_ledger":[{"tool":"file_read","target":"app/page.tsx","outcome":"hit","snippet":"File: app/page.tsx (300 lines total, showing 1-300) 1 /** 2 * v0 by Vercel. 3 * @see https://v0.dev/t/hu3XTCEi3UO 4 * Documentation: https://v0.dev/docs#integrating-generated-code-into-your-nextjs-app 5 */ 6 import { Button } from \"@/compon"},{"tool":"file_read","target":"components/ui/button.tsx","outcome":"hit","snippet":"File: components/ui/button.tsx (57 lines total, showing 1-57) 1 import * as React from \"react\" 2 import { Slot } from \"@radix-ui/react-slot\" 3 import { cva, type VariantProps } from \"class-variance-authority\" 4 5 import { cn } from \"@/lib/u"},{"tool":"file_write","target":"app/page.tsx","outcome":"hit","snippet":"Replaced in app/page.tsx: 1161 chars → 679 chars (content chang